### Get all account mappings
GET http://localhost:8088/api/v1/account-mappings

### Create account mapping
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/account-mappings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rawAccount": "mKonto Intensive 5611 ... 1026",
  "displayName": "mBank ROR"
}

### Create multiple account mappings
POST http://localhost:8088/api/v1/account-mappings/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "rawAccount": "mKonto Intensive 5611 ... 1026",
    "displayName": "mBank ROR"
  },
  {
    "rawAccount": "WORLD MASTERCARD INTENSIVE 5272********4049",
    "displayName": "Kredytowa mBank Darek"
  },
  {
    "rawAccount": "mBiznes konto Standard 9311 ... 7527",
    "displayName": "Firmowe mBank"
  }
]

### Update an account mapping (replace 1 with a real id; back-fills the display name onto its operations)
PUT http://localhost:8088/api/v1/account-mappings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rawAccount": "mKonto Intensive 5611 ... 1026",
  "displayName": "mBank main account"
}

### Delete an account mapping (its operations revert to the raw account)
DELETE http://localhost:8088/api/v1/account-mappings/1
